ace15.safetensors)\n- [qwen_1.7b_ace15.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ace_step_1.5_ComfyUI_files/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_1.7b_ace15.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [ace_1.5_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ace_step_1.5_ComfyUI_files/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ace_1.5_vae.safetensors)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── acestep_v1.5 XL_turbo.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   ├── qwen_0.6b_ace15.safetensors\n│   │   └── qwen_1.7b_ace15.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│       └── ace_1.5_vae.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud will be updated after the stable release; nightly-supported models may not be included yet, please wait for the next stable release.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":204,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-783.0916336497899,-814.507741726269],"size":[584.3639697376566,655.2231044337929],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"ComfyUI-AceStep15-LLMAuto node install and Ollama setup","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["**Custom Node for Ace Step 1.5XL Ollama workflow**\n\n- [TextEncodeAceStepAudio 1.5 (LLM Auto)](https://github.com/Frogman-art/ComfyUI-AceStep15-LLMAuto-custom-node/blob/main/ComfyUI-AceStep15-LLMAuto.zip)\n\n**How to install**\n\nGo to custom node directory, create a folder called ComfyUI-AceStep15-LLMAuto and extract contents of ComfyUI-AceStep15-LLMAuto.zip into it.\n\n\n## ComfyUI-AceStep15-LLMAuto storage location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 custom_nodes/\n│   ├── 📂 ComfyUI-AceStep15-LLMAuto/\n│   │   ├── __init__.py\n│   │   └── README.md\n```\n\n\n**Installing and configuring Ollama**\n\nGo to https://ollama.com/ download and install Ollama. Ollama needs to be running in the background for this workflow\n\nOnce installed, open a command prompt and enter\n\nOllama pull qwen3.5:9b\n\nOr\n\nOllama pull nexusriot/qwen3.5-abliterated:9b\n\nrefresh comfyui browser (restarting server not neccecery). The model you pulled should show up in the Ollama Connectivity node in the workflow.\n\n\n**Recommended Ollama models**\n\n\nqwen3.5:9b seems to work great and if you get any refusals, nexusriot/qwen3.5-abliterated:9b Find them on Ollama.com.\n\n\n\n\n"],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"}],"links":[[119,47,0,3,2,"CONDITIONING"],[175,78,0,3,0,"MODEL"],[249,98,0,3,3,"LATENT"],[250,99,0,98,0,"FLOAT"],[258,102,0,3,4,"INT"],[264,109,0,78,0,"MODEL"],[265,106,0,110,1,"VAE"],[266,3,0,110,0,"LATENT"],[267,110,0,107,0,"AUDIO"],[268,114,0,115,0,"OLLAMA_CONNECTIVITY"],[269,120,0,115,1,"OLLAMA_OPTIONS"],[271,117,0,116,0,"STRING"],[272,114,0,117,0,"OLLAMA_CONNECTIVITY"],[273,120,0,117,1,"OLLAMA_OPTIONS"],[275,115,0,118,0,"STRING"],[276,123,0,115,6,"STRING"],[329,123,0,117,6,"STRING"],[332,115,0,166,6,"STRING"],[333,115,0,167,6,"STRING"],[334,115,0,168,6,"STRING"],[336,114,0,166,0,"OLLAMA_CONNECTIVITY"],[337,120,0,166,1,"OLLAMA_OPTIONS"],[338,166,0,169,0,"STRING"],[339,114,0,167,0,"OLLAMA_CONNECTIVITY"],[340,114,0,168,0,"OLLAMA_CONNECTIVITY"],[341,120,0,167,1,"OLLAMA_OPTIONS"],[342,120,0,168,1,"OLLAMA_OPTIONS"],[344,167,0,170,0,"STRING"],[345,168,0,171,0,"STRING"],[350,177,0,117,5,"STRING"],[351,178,0,115,5,"STRING"],[397,168,0,199,17,"STRING"],[398,167,0,199,16,"STRING"],[399,166,0,199,15,"STRING"],[400,199,0,3,1,"CONDITIONING"],[401,199,0,47,0,"CONDITIONING"],[402,102,0,199,3,"INT"],[403,99,0,199,5,"FLOAT"],[404,115,0,199,1,"STRING"],